   "mode": 0,
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Seamless tiles for rooms (floors, walls, fabric)\n**VTube Pro workflow, 16 GB graphics card** (Z-Image-Turbo + FLUX.2 klein 4B). Pack 2026.10.01.\n\nSquare textures that repeat with no visible seam: wood floor, brick, carpet, tiles, fabric.\n\n## How to use it\n1. Say the material in \"Your prompt\" (keep \"flat, even lighting\").\n2. Press Run. The workflow swaps the halves and repaints the seams for you.\n3. Find the result in ComfyUI's **output/VTubePro** folder (or right-click the picture > Save Image).\n\nThe **green boxes** are the ones to change.\n\n**You get:** 1024x1024 PNG that tiles in both directions.\n\n**In VTube Pro:** Use it in your room's material in Blender (or the room creation package). 1024 px fits VTube Pro's texture budget.\n\n**Settings:** 1024x1024, 8 steps, CFG 1; seam band repainted at denoise 0.7.\n\n## Models (all allow commercial use)\n- [z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo) (12.3 GB) in `models/diffusion_models`: Apache-2.0\n- [qwen_3_4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo) (8.0 GB) in `models/text_encoders`: Apache-2.0\n- [ae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo) (0.3 GB) in `models/vae`: Apache-2.0\n\nMissing a model? ComfyUI offers to download it when you open this workflow. Or ask your AI: \n*\"Set up the VTube Pro seamless tile workflow in ComfyUI\"*: the VTube Pro Helper downloads every file from its official page, checks it, and adds this workflow, after you say yes.\n\n## Tips\n- Baked shadows repeat badly: ask for flat, even light.\n- Check it: put four copies side by side in any editor.\n- Make pictures when you are not live: picture AI slows face tracking."
   ],
